  "details": "On all the official VRchat websites you can find links to the old social media accounts. \nThere is also an extreme inconsistency of when what social media gets plugged.\n\nBecause of this its harder to find out what social media VRchat has.\n\nIt would be nice to see this actually get updated so new users wont have to spend time finding out how to follow the game on social media.\nAnd that all the locations share the same social media so you will always be guided towards all social media.\n\nI was able to find the outdated links on these locations:\n\n1. https://www.vrchat.net/faq\nIf you scroll down on the page you can find an outdated Twitter and Instagram account.\nUnder the “I want to get involved! Where does the community reside when they aren't in VRChat?” question you are also able to find a different outdated facebook group link.\n\n2. https://vrchat.com/contact\nThe twitter button links towards the same outdated account as by 1.\nThe facebook button also links towards a outdated group.\n\n3. The social tab.\nOnce you hover over the “Social” tab at the top of the screen you get the old Facebook and Twitter link.\n\n4. https://medium.com/@vrchat\nThe small Twitter button sends you to the old Twitter account.\n\n5. https://vrchat.threadless.com/about\nThe small Twitter button is again outdated.",
